 "intro": [
  "$S(a)=\\int_0^\\pi\\frac{\\sin x}{a^2-\\cos^2x}dx=\\frac1a\\ln\\frac{a+1}{a-1}$.",
  "$[0,\\pi]$: $\\frac\\pi2S$, $[\\pi,2\\pi]$: $x=\\pi+u$로 $\\frac{3\\pi}2S$ → 합 $2\\pi S$, 단조로 $a=3$."
